provider: jenkins (Jenkins)
=== snippet for Jenkinsfile (add this stage)
stage('Gravity') {
  environment {
    GRAVITY_TOKEN = credentials('gravity-token')
    GRAVITY_API_URL = 'https://api.acme.test'
  }
  steps {
    sh 'curl -fsSL https://app.gravitydocs.io/install.sh | GRAVITY_VERSION=1 GRAVITY_INSTALL_DIR="$WORKSPACE/.gravity-bin" sh'
    sh '"$WORKSPACE/.gravity-bin/gravity" run'
  }
}
=== paste: add it as a Secret text credential with ID gravity-token (Manage Jenkins > Credentials)
